    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience action-packed Beyblade battles in a stadium equipped with BEYBLADE X's signature X-celerator Rail as you unleash the Xtreme Dash and use the game's original &quot;Active Gauge&quot; to execute exciting tactical maneuvers! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0STORY</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A completely new story featuring original game characters! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023070/extras/fe486ae831d869551685a9166df26652.avif?t=1743498862\" width=500 height=141 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new tournament, The X Championship, is being held at The X. Compete with rivals, deepen bonds, and aim for the top of The X! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0BATTLE</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completely recreates the ultra-accelerated battles of BEYBLADE X! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the impact of extreme acceleration in a stadium equipped with the X-celerator Rail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023070/extras/66b487f07da8948fa3fc0f67f1c2c5f1.avif?t=1743498862\" width=500 height=140 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you &quot;Let it rip!&quot;, the &quot;Active Gauge&quot; fills over time. Use it to unleash critical &quot;Attacks&quot; and &quot;Counters&quot; one after another!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023070/extras/20c4401206ad70de088adc2dc0fb5730.avif?t=1743498862\" width=500 height=140 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleashing critical attacks increases the X Gauge! When it reaches MAX, choose the skill you want to activate. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skills operate on a rock-paper-scissors system. Choose a skill that gives you an advantage over your opponent!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023070/extras/8211597b7a0282c20f8a1eae78258fdf.avif?t=1743498862\" width=500 height=140 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you win, activate the skill and knock your opponent out in spectacular fashion! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0CUSTOMIZE</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customization takes X Skills into account and offers over 100 million possible combinations!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely combine parts and skills to set up your Beyblade just the way you want. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023070/extras/182358141adb1c2b65a0e0d0be6082bf.avif?t=1743498862\" width=500 height=140 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0ONLINE BATTLES</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In online battles, you can compete against Bladers from all corners of the globe anytime, anywhere! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge Bladers from around the world and aim for the top. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023070/extras/612ff2da52e35a2da5958ce754cf68e5.avif?t=1743498862\" width=500 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*The ranking specifications may differ slightly from other platforms.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0DOWNLOADABLE CONTENT</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional Beyblades will be gradually released as downloadable content! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a9Homura Kawamoto, Hikaru Muno, Posuka Demizu, BBXProject, TV TOKYO </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a9 \uff34\uff2f\uff2d\uff39</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a9 FURYU Corporation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*All images are from an in-development version of the game. Content and specifications may differ in the final product.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience action-packed Beyblade battles in a stadium equipped with BEYBLADE X's signature X-celerator Rail as you unleash the Xtreme Dash and use the game's original &quot;Active Gauge&quot; to execute exciting tactical maneuvers! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0STORY</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A completely new story featuring original game characters! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023070/extras/fe486ae831d869551685a9166df26652.avif?t=1743498862\" width=500 height=141 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new tournament, The X Championship, is being held at The X. Compete with rivals, deepen bonds, and aim for the top of The X! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0BATTLE</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completely recreates the ultra-accelerated battles of BEYBLADE X! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the impact of extreme acceleration in a stadium equipped with the X-celerator Rail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023070/extras/66b487f07da8948fa3fc0f67f1c2c5f1.avif?t=1743498862\" width=500 height=140 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you &quot;Let it rip!&quot;, the &quot;Active Gauge&quot; fills over time. Use it to unleash critical &quot;Attacks&quot; and &quot;Counters&quot; one after another!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023070/extras/20c4401206ad70de088adc2dc0fb5730.avif?t=1743498862\" width=500 height=140 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleashing critical attacks increases the X Gauge! When it reaches MAX, choose the skill you want to activate. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skills operate on a rock-paper-scissors system. Choose a skill that gives you an advantage over your opponent!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023070/extras/8211597b7a0282c20f8a1eae78258fdf.avif?t=1743498862\" width=500 height=140 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you win, activate the skill and knock your opponent out in spectacular fashion! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0CUSTOMIZE</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customization takes X Skills into account and offers over 100 million possible combinations!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely combine parts and skills to set up your Beyblade just the way you want. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023070/extras/182358141adb1c2b65a0e0d0be6082bf.avif?t=1743498862\" width=500 height=140 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0ONLINE BATTLES</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In online battles, you can compete against Bladers from all corners of the globe anytime, anywhere! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge Bladers from around the world and aim for the top. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023070/extras/612ff2da52e35a2da5958ce754cf68e5.avif?t=1743498862\" width=500 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*The ranking specifications may differ slightly from other platforms.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0DOWNLOADABLE CONTENT</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional Beyblades will be gradually released as downloadable content! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a9Homura Kawamoto, Hikaru Muno, Posuka Demizu, BBXProject, TV TOKYO </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a9 \uff34\uff2f\uff2d\uff39</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a9 FURYU Corporation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*All images are from an in-development version of the game. Content and specifications may differ in the final product.</p>",
    "short_description": "'BEYBLADE X XONE is a &quot;Beyblade action&quot; game that faithfully recreates the BEYBLADE X series (distributed by TOMY Company, Ltd.) that is popular among fans of all ages. Battle through intense Beybattles and aim for the top of The X!",
